## The Discovery & Definition Space

Discovery is about getting to the point of why we are doing something, what us feasible relative to what we have today and the resources available (squad size, talent, time) - and *also*, as a **Technologist**, being aware of the technologies in the tech landscape that could be candidates for solutions, beyond what we have today - the beginning of the *solutions* conversation with Engineering.

